# --- Line endings (added 2026-11-11, repo review item 8) ---
# Store text as LF in the repo, check out native. Scripts that run on Linux are always LF
# (CRLF breaks shebangs and heredocs); Windows batch files are always CRLF.
* text=auto
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
